When i try to print more than one job at the same time, from DecUnix to a
printer connected to Microsoft Windows95 only the first job comes out....
the rest just vanishes.

The Print Client Software on Digital Unix has the following parameters:

	- Printer Name:			(name)
	- Printer Server:			(IP address of the machine)
	- Transport:			tcp
	- Connection type:		Direct
	- Location:			LPT1
	- Translation File:		none
	- Last Page Control:		Formfeed
	- Print Mode:			nocrlf
	- Spool Directory:		/var/spool/(name)
	- Log File:			/var/adm/(name).err


Microsoft Windows95 has Pathworks Print Service Instaled.


